### Notes: 2024-05-19 (matthewda)
- disable glib mainloop on NetBSD - cpu usage decreases.
- opengl seems to be working on NetBSD

### Notes: 2026-09-03 (moihack)
- OpenGL acceleration works but in Intel N3540 (Baytrail) HD graphics
can cause graphic glitches when the mixer applet is left in the panel. 
Temporary remedy is to remove the mixer applet permanently from the panel,
if you find glitches and/or enlightenment desktop stays at a black screen 
when composition is HW accelerated.
Probably only cauase by the troublesome Baytrail graphcis though and may
never happen with other GPUs.

- Wayland is entirely untested

